# KI-007: Cooling an active catalytic mixture slows the next interval
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL @ 35C
add v1 H2O2 0.001mol
add v1 MnO2 0.001g
wait 15s
measure v1 thermometer
inspect v1
cool v1 4kJ
measure v1 thermometer
wait 15s
inspect v1
inspect
